# Wireframe: Splash Loading Screen

## Purpose & Flow Context

Brief loading state shown while the AuthStore hydrates session state from the refresh token cookie on app start. Serves the "App Start & Session Hydration" flow step. Entry: user opens the application. Exit: main app (authenticated) or login screen (unauthenticated).

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[====]` | Skeleton / loading placeholder | `⟳` | Spinner animation |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `main` only |
| Heading order | No heading — brief interstitial |
| Keyboard | No interactive elements on this screen |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Content centered in a single column.

**App-shell**: No shared shell — full-bleed centered content before auth is resolved.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Page bg | Full-viewport background | Same as login screen bg for visual continuity |
| Center | Spinner + status text | Vertically and horizontally centered |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Spinner — primary indicator something is happening
2. Status text — explains what's happening

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                            [ ⟳ ]                                  |
|                       Checking your session...                     |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Spinner | Spinner | CSS rotation animation | Hidden when hydration completes |
| Status text | (generic `<span>`) | Static text below spinner | `role="status"`, `aria-live="polite"` |

## Data Display

Not applicable.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Status text | "Checking your session..." | Brief, informative, transient |

## States

### Loading (Default)

The layout shown in the ASCII sketch above. Only state this screen exists in.

### Error

Not applicable — hydration failures (expired/absent refresh token) transition to login screen rather than showing error on this screen.

### Populated / Empty / Success

Not applicable — this is a transient interstitial with a single loading state.

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Centered layout as shown |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same |
| Mobile (<768px) | Same — minimal layout unaffected |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `main` wrapping the content |
| Heading order | No heading — `h1` will be on the destination screen |
| Reading / Focus order | Focus is not programmatically moved; screen reader announces spinner via `role="status"` |
| Accessible names | Spinner has `aria-label="Loading"` |
| Keyboard operability | No interactive elements — Tab does nothing |
| Target size | No interactive targets on this screen |
| Focus not obscured | No sticky regions |
| Non-color intent | Spinner animation + text, no color alone |
